{
  "name": "@shaida/underwrite",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Shaida's underwriting bot: a deterministic decision (APPROVE / DECLINE / INCONCLUSIVE) from an income proof link and a versioned policy, after the full PRD §5 verification. No LLM. Chain reads, Groth16, clock and store are injected; an optional attest-only recorder with daily caps.",
